Firecrawl example
-----------------

hello_firecrawl.py is a tiny, self-contained example that scrapes a web page
with Firecrawl and prints its content as Markdown -- a "Hello World" for web
data extraction.

Setup:

    pip install -r requirements.txt
    cp .env.example .env        # then add your FIRECRAWL_API_KEY

Run:

    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY="fc-..."
    python hello_firecrawl.py [URL]   # defaults to https://example.com

Get a free API key and read the docs at https://docs.firecrawl.dev
